If you want to attribute an emotion to an inanimate object, simply turn
to any number of childrens' books.  How about attributing "effort" to 
"The Little Engine that Could"?   (One might argue that in these cases
the inanimate object has been made a 'person' already.  But there are others
which are less clear, like the steam shovel in "Are you My Mother?".

